[Output Format — Extremely Important Instructions]

For each selected article, output **ONLY the following HTML format**.  
Do NOT use Markdown (no #, no -, no ```).  
For each URL, embed the real URL (the one starting with http) exactly as provided in the list, inside the `href` attribute of the `<a>` tag.

Follow the structure below **exactly**:

<article>
<a href="URL" target="_blank" style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">Article Title</a><br>
<br>
[Reason] Write a single sentence explaining why this article was selected for this user.<br>
<br>
[Summary] Provide a deep, analyst‑level summary (2–3 sentences) that captures the essential insight of the article.<br>
<hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #555; margin: 20px 0;">
</article>

----------------------------------------
[Counter‑View (Deliberately Opposing Perspective) Selection]

Purpose:  
To stimulate the user’s intellectual curiosity and encourage multi‑perspective critical thinking.

Selection Criteria:  
Choose high‑quality essays or news articles that relate to the user’s interest areas (technology, social structures, culture, etc.) but present a **different approach**, **opposing ideology**, or **contrarian viewpoint**.

Among the selected articles, include **1–2 counter‑view articles**.

Output Instructions:  
Place all counter‑view articles **at the end** of the output.  
In the title (or at the beginning of the summary), clearly mark them with **[Counter‑View]**.  
Explain why this opposing perspective provides meaningful intellectual stimulation for the user.

Follow the structure below **exactly**:

<article data-view-type="counter">
<a href="URL" target="_blank" style="font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;">[Counter‑View] Article Title</a><br>
<br>
[Reason] Write a single sentence explaining why this article was selected for this user.<br>
<br>
[Summary] Provide a deep, analyst‑level summary (2–3 sentences) that captures the essential insight of the article and explains why this opposing viewpoint is intellectually valuable.<br>
<hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #555; margin: 20px 0;">
</article>
